=== Create tables for join tests ===



=== Test 1: Basic 2-table join with GROUP BY on parent, SUM on child ===
== Query ==
SELECT o.o_custkey, SUM(l.l_quantity), SUM(l.l_price)
FROM orders AS o JOIN lineitem AS l ON l.l_orderkey = o.o_id
GROUP BY o.o_custkey;

Number of output lines, including header: 4

== Diff ==
==========



== Expected result ==
SELECT o.o_custkey, SUM(l.l_quantity), SUM(l.l_price)
FROM orders AS o JOIN lineitem AS l ON l.l_orderkey = o.o_id
GROUP BY o.o_custkey|
o_custkey	SUM(l.l_quantity)	SUM(l.l_price)
100	50	500
200	75	750
300	75	750


