=== Test 10: Error — WHERE on child table ===
Expected error: WHERE conditions on joined tables are not yet supported.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: WHERE conditions on joined tables are not yet supported. Only the root table (first in FROM) may be filtered.

=== Create composite key table ===


=== Test 13: Composite PK join (multi-column ON) ===
== Query ==
SELECT o.o_custkey, SUM(oe.oe_note_val)
FROM orders AS o JOIN order_extra AS oe
ON oe.oe_orderid = o.o_id AND oe.oe_custkey = o.o_custkey
GROUP BY o.o_custkey;

Number of output lines, including header: 4

== Diff ==
==========



== Expected result ==
SELECT o.o_custkey, SUM(oe.oe_note_val)
FROM orders AS o JOIN order_extra AS oe
ON oe.oe_orderid = o.o_id AND oe.oe_custkey = o.o_custkey
GROUP BY o.o_custkey|
o_custkey	SUM(oe.oe_note_val)
100	30
200	70
300	50


=== Test 14: Root PK lookup (WHERE covers full PK) ===
== Query ==
SELECT o.o_id, SUM(l.l_quantity)
FROM orders AS o JOIN lineitem AS l ON l.l_orderkey = o.o_id
WHERE o.o_id = 1
GROUP BY o.o_id;

Number of output lines, including header: 2

== Diff ==
==========



== Expected result ==
SELECT o.o_id, SUM(l.l_quantity)
FROM orders AS o JOIN lineitem AS l ON l.l_orderkey = o.o_id
WHERE o.o_id = 1
GROUP BY o.o_id|
o_id	SUM(l.l_quantity)
1	30

